  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Dashboard by the kettle",
    "overview": "A light dashboard on paper, with green ink, a calm green accent and readable brewing values. Flat sections and compact labels keep the tea table easy to scan; a regular-weight timer balances the stronger values and wordmark.\n\nThe shared `@lazy/theme` package owns the visual foundation. The app owns its responsive brewing layout, tablet density and inline time editor. This migration preserves the established light appearance and device sizing.",
